1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,350
Want a little company while you read?
Add an animal to the page.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:11,250
Select Animal, then select it again
to open the animal menu.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,775
Pick a cow, dog, or cat, and click the paper
to set your new reading buddy down.

4
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,225
Turn up Speed and Activities
to give them a little more energy.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,775
Switch to Read, then drag your companion
to a better spot.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:36,675
Need a whole study group? Open the animal menu
and choose Magic wand.

7
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,825
Enjoy Papol.
